st girls of that age do. We've grown up a lot in the past eight years. Tim's passion made her a little dizzy, so she married him. She always acted like an angel in front of him. If she loved him, she couldn't have done half of that. Virginia has many little demons in her heart. But I can tell you one thing, she likes freedom. No one can make her give up her freedom.\" [2871] \"I'm curious why you're telling me all this,\" Anthony said slowly. [2872] \"It's interesting to know about people, just some people.\" [2873] \"I am interested,\" he admitted. [2874] \"You've never heard about Virginia, but you can trust me, I have inside information. Virginia is a sweetheart, even women like her because she's not at all mean.\" [2875] \"Of course,\" Anthony agreed. But he was still confused. He didn't understand why Bandler was telling him all this. But he couldn't deny that he was happy. [2876] \"The tram has arrived,\" Bandler sighed. \"I'll have to be careful driving.\" [2877] \"I agree,\" Anthony concurred. [2878] Their definitions of careful driving were vastly different. After leaving the disgruntled suburban crowd behind, they finally arrived on Oxford Street. [2879] \"Not bad,\" Bandler glanced at his watch and said. [2880] Anthony nodded in agreement. [2881] \"Where do you get off?\" [2882] \"Anywhere, where are you going?\" [2883] \"Knightsbridge Road.\" [2884] \"Alright, drop me off at the Hyde Park corner.\" [2885] \"Goodbye,\" Bandel stopped at the specified location, \"What about the return trip?\" [2886] \"I'll figure it out myself, thank you very much.\" [2887] \"I scared him,\" Bunder said. [2888] \"I wouldn't recommend a neurotic old lady sitting in your car for a pick-me-up, but I personally found it quite amusing. The last time I was in such a situation, I was being attacked by a herd of elephants.\" [2889] \"You're rude,\" Bunder said, \"We didn't even have any bumps on the road today.\" [2890] \"If it was because of me that you were more restrained today